<h2 local-id=3D"02b87c6c5673" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-2.Environment&amp;UnitArchitec=
ture">2. Environment &amp; Unit Architecture</h2>
<p local-id=3D"ab9b1332a9e3">To maintain isolation, monitoring, and RBAC co=
mpliance, all Kafka resources must be bound to standardized naming formats =
according to the environment and target application domain.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"03=
84a7c5-6ad3-407a-a16b-40654a2d5a95" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e817ab57-65b8-4c65-817b-d7ad57f43061">
<td data-local-id=3D"e47c2545-c234-4a2f-8b3a-05bea7d6f268" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46b330b7fcb1"><strong>Environment</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4f653644-d52f-483a-9bad-a3ca77ff2111" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74f91a9c2180"><strong>Prefix / Code</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3e147882-7694-4383-89b4-7f5e7a3bd0a2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1a12abc8b5b3"><strong>Purpose</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3fdbb3c5-3624-453a-b6c9-334268381052">
<td data-local-id=3D"acd9554b-3b1d-4b08-8a4c-a1c56526dc32" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"133749f5d472"><strong>Development</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a0f79cfa-7452-484a-9b45-3e2fc6106c52" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a64b432c6515"><code>dev</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a05dadef-d0d2-498e-8f58-d8e824b384dd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3de5e2ced5cf">Sandbox testing and unit integration.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"11f34d6a-33fe-448b-98f7-9e771ccef1eb">
<td data-local-id=3D"75238766-5fef-4910-9181-4d0f30d40bea" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"56718349534b"><strong>User Acceptance Testing</strong></p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f6701101-a803-4b91-beb7-3b9f3596adf8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ce97ca7d41e"><code>uat</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be2100dd-cd13-41ea-998d-6f0ae7d88b1b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a9e5e71f6784">Staging, QA, and integration testing.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"436356c8-37de-441d-8d20-2fe8cf6336ec">
<td data-local-id=3D"557d943d-555a-4f02-a25c-f847ee76838c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37f831e11e0a"><strong>Production</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"def6d32b-697b-4397-a015-d264662e340d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"430227f00ac3"><code>prd</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5b95a099-d509-43aa-8f9a-fd61230f19b6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"78bddd722b13">High-availability production workloads.</p></t=
d>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"92b0f59ac24c" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-3.NamingConventions">3. Naming=
 Conventions</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"40c0c4e6cdee" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-3.1Topics">3.1 Topics</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ea0acd509caa">All topic names must use lowercase letters, nu=
mbers, and hyphens (<code>-</code>). Use dots (<code>.</code>) strictly as =
logical level separators. <strong>Do not use underscores (</strong><code>_<=
/code><strong>).</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"20cd65a4cbea"><strong>Format:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">&lt;env=
&gt;.&lt;domain&gt;.&lt;entity&gt;.&lt;event-type&gt;.&lt;version&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"e1e8100c7ea3"><strong>Components:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"2bed2fec-1be6-4631-a6d9-13f5352a7a35">
<li local-id=3D"f41bacff-bc3a-40a2-94bb-21c9a005d4b2">
<p local-id=3D"d8b44916def1"><code>env</code>: <code>dev</code>, <code>uat<=
/code>, or <code>prd</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"23a88e95-2999-43cd-9df5-dff22c3cf342">
<p local-id=3D"9af8a0653f0d"><code>domain</code>: Bounded context or busine=
ss unit (e.g., <code>inventory</code>, <code>payments</code>, <code>telemet=
ry</code>, <code>orders</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9591b468-d3e0-4972-8d59-4677479419cc">
<p local-id=3D"b656b8cf9c47"><code>entity</code>: Core business object (e.g=
., <code>invoice</code>, <code>shipment</code>, <code>user</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"486766af-77fc-4b91-a6b3-0ff692d7a305">
<p local-id=3D"b0182ed739f6"><code>event-type</code>: State change, intent,=
 or system signal (e.g., <code>created</code>, <code>updated</code>, <code>=
requested</code>, <code>raw</code>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"799c1b46-bc44-421a-a9f7-b58f0afe5ddc">
<p local-id=3D"bad8a9083b1c"><code>version</code>: Schema version string pr=
efixed with <code>v</code> (e.g., <code>v1</code>, <code>v2</code>)</p></li=
>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"fcc586eb35b2"><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"ffb9e331-85d7-4a58-96b7-41eb824f0121">
<li local-id=3D"468f4d2f-6e12-4ac3-8b64-cf7352eba1e5">
<p local-id=3D"e0e73ac450b2"><code>prd.payments.invoice.created.v1</code></=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5c42a9f4-5c7d-4e02-8d07-8545a268f14e">
<p local-id=3D"93d0b6966c30"><code>dev.inventory.shipment.updated.v1</code>=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6ba07728-5276-4aa3-b0b6-978cbaa9fdd0">
<p local-id=3D"a1520c6f4bc1"><code>uat.telemetry.sensor.raw.v2</code></p></=
li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"0b7ed1a275b1" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-3.2ConsumerGroups">3.2 Consume=
r Groups</h3>
<p local-id=3D"35aba51a7cb9">Consumer Group IDs must reflect the consuming =
application, domain, and target processing logic to allow easy tracking in =
Confluent Control Center.</p>
<p local-id=3D"dc265cbbf564"><strong>Format:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">cg-&lt;=
env&gt;-&lt;consuming-app&gt;-&lt;domain&gt;-&lt;purpose&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"32f36104a4a1"><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"adf14d2b-2940-48a0-836a-e6fd4afd0b8d">
<li local-id=3D"4b6c4dcd-ac1e-4441-9e3f-8c1934fe2cb4">
<p local-id=3D"be6068d49b22"><code>cg-prd-billing-service-payments-settleme=
nt</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cfe0376e-cb11-455c-8c67-e35400099572">
<p local-id=3D"a08ba7712102"><code>cg-dev-analytics-engine-inventory-indexe=
r</code></p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"5a7c956eb07b" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-3.3SchemaRegistrySubjectNames"=
>3.3 Schema Registry Subject Names</h3>
<p local-id=3D"d40a702aea8f">Use the standard <strong>TopicNameStrategy</st=
rong> for schema subject naming to align automatically with topic definitio=
ns.</p>
<p local-id=3D"af4c44b24f6c"><strong>Format:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">&lt;top=
ic-name&gt;-key
&lt;topic-name&gt;-value
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"605ef95876e5"><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"deabef66-3f91-444d-9e6a-58a690c8e785">
<li local-id=3D"4cf3c91f-f5ca-47a0-aad5-3b97c1e5e075">
<p local-id=3D"04709e2557b1"><code>prd.payments.invoice.created.v1-value</c=
ode></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f17beec5-200d-44d4-b189-d63b8b293f69">
<p local-id=3D"5928eef82943"><code>prd.payments.invoice.created.v1-key</cod=
e></p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"62709e769caa" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-3.4KafkaConnect(Connectors)">3=
.4 Kafka Connect (Connectors)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"2b6f7699f44d">Source and Sink connectors must specify direct=
ionality, plugin type, and the target integration system.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8c16984a2ac4"><strong>Format:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">conn-&l=
t;env&gt;-&lt;source/sink&gt;-&lt;connector-type&gt;-&lt;target-system&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"6db11f4f0bc8"><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"0a85cd29-28f1-4e56-a48f-e217297063a7">
<li local-id=3D"81b92fa9-c6c3-4b7c-adc4-e3f3aa6a619d">
<p local-id=3D"f041b6c9f7b2"><code>conn-prd-source-debezium-postgres-orders=
</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"95ac81cf-8852-43e7-a068-55a00efe81d9">
<p local-id=3D"4e3114a8c5a9"><code>conn-uat-sink-s3-analytics-bucket</code>=
</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"bbb9e8b3add3" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-4.StandardConfigurationBaselin=
e">4. Standard Configuration Baseline</h2>
