<h2 local-id=3D"de2d46209ee0" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-5.Step-by-StepResourceProvisio=
ningGuide">5. Step-by-Step Resource Provisioning Guide</h2>
<p local-id=3D"c27182abe512">Follow these sequential steps to create and co=
nfigure resources using the Confluent CLI or Confluent Cloud Console.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ab6457c66054"><strong>1.Submit Architecture &amp; Request Re=
view:</strong>Prerequisite Verification.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8197cab58986">Before creating resources in <code>prd</code> =
or <code>uat</code>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ea8ed942-29f5-41b2-9f32-15cfe72bfc3e">
<li local-id=3D"beaf9bac-6901-47d6-88d3-17b3ddc3bc89">
<p local-id=3D"7cd88a54649e">Verify schema definitions (Avro / JSON / Proto=
buf) with the data governance team.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2087496d-5534-4b90-95d6-dfaac12dbb4e">
<p local-id=3D"0eaf7a62d92c">Estimate throughput (MB/s), peak message volum=
e, and required retention periods.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"31a450cb-622d-4809-ab9a-37a2fc4ad00a">
<p local-id=3D"03dc15d2ad97">Create a Jira infrastructure request assigned =
to <strong>Balaji K</strong> or <strong>Ananya Roy</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0429190b2462"><strong>2.Authenticate &amp; Set Target Contex=
t:</strong>Confluent CLI Setup.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9232f018141a">Ensure you are targeting the correct Confluent=
 environment and cluster before executing commands.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Bash</p=
re>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Log i=
n to Confluent Cloud
confluent login

# Set active environment
confluent environment list
confluent environment use env-xxxxxx

# Set active Kafka cluster
confluent kafka cluster list
confluent kafka cluster use lkc-xxxxxx
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"94811e5ae9ec"><strong>3.Register Schema in Schema Registry:<=
/strong>Schema-First Design.</p>
<p local-id=3D"53c5431af458">Register the key and value schema definitions =
to the target environment schema registry before creating producing topics.=
</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Bash</p=
re>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">conflue=
nt schema-registry schema create \
  --subject prd.payments.invoice.created.v1-value \
  --schema invoice_value_v1.avsc \
  --type avro
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"13bb7efd3a34"><strong>4.Provision the Kafka Topic:</strong>S=
tandardized Topic Creation.</p>
<p local-id=3D"073553a9d44c">Create the topic applying standard replication=
 and partition baseline constraints.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Bash</p=
re>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">conflue=
nt kafka topic create prd.payments.invoice.created.v1 \
  --partitions 6 \
  --config min.insync.replicas=3D2 \
  --config retention.ms=3D2592000000 \
  --config cleanup.policy=3Ddelete
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"ca83ecb68e62"><strong>5.Configure Service Account &amp; RBAC=
 Permissions:</strong>Least-Privilege Security Policy.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b2e4614279f3">Do not use administrative API keys for applica=
tion deployment. Create a dedicated service account and apply scoped Role-B=
ased Access Control (RBAC).</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Bash</p=
re>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Creat=
e application service account
confluent iam service-account create sa-payment-service \
  --description "Service account for payment processor application"

# Grant DeveloperRead / DeveloperWrite roles on the specific topic
confluent iam rbac role-binding create \
  --principal User:sa-xxxxx \
  --role DeveloperWrite \
  --resource Topic:prd.payments.invoice.created.v1 \
  --kafka-cluster-id lkc-xxxxxx
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"55552148310b"><strong>6.Verification &amp; Monitoring Setup:=
</strong>Post-Deployment Check.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"33d4a0d3-f31b-4333-8fad-2fb74e7ff254">
<li local-id=3D"2386ae98-dc1a-415b-9229-c4b69b69852d">
<p local-id=3D"ac23c3147397">Verify topic creation and configuration parame=
ters in <strong>Confluent Control Center</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14c73d43-cb3d-4adb-bd99-85e795d65d59">
<p local-id=3D"342adce499a2">Validate producer connectivity and schema vali=
dation rules.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6f00e56c-50fd-469a-9c3a-b754fd9ad2fd">
<p local-id=3D"8439692fe5ae">Set up lag alert thresholds in Datadog / Grafa=
na using the consumer group ID <code>cg-prd-billing-service-payments-settle=
ment</code>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"06b2eeef4618" id=3D"StandardOperatingProcedure:ConfluentKaf=
kaNamingConventions&amp;ResourceProvisioning-6.Support&amp;TroubleshootingC=
ontact">6. Support &amp; Troubleshooting Contact</h2>
<p local-id=3D"42195c5f91a9">For architecture reviews, permission requests,=
 or cluster troubleshooting, contact:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6cb08767-3a26-4f6a-a1d5-98cd58a4e7ce">
<li local-id=3D"9d9fb6be-dc0b-4789-8d32-75a4ab121b71">
<p local-id=3D"f72fdfceab91"><strong>Kafka Operations Channel:</strong> <co=
de>#kafka-platform-support</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1e8096f2-3ee4-40e0-a4ac-ffa119ecde78">
<p local-id=3D"eb7bfcde9896"><strong>Lead Contact:</strong> Balaji K (<code=
>balaji.k@company.com</code>)</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
